flowchart TB
    SO[Secure Outcomes\nSafe | Trusted | Compliant | Resilient | Expected]
    CP[Governance, Telemetry and Assurance Control Plane\nAdapt + Assure]
    ATF[Agent Trust Fabric\nAssess: Identity, Intent, Context, Goal, Risk, Behavior, Delegation]
    R1[Ring 1: Trust Establishment\nPrevent: ownership, identity, least agency, sandboxing, supply chain, memory integrity]
    R2[Ring 2: Trust Enforcement\nPrevent + Enforce: contextual authorization, PDP/PEP, objective boundaries, tool/data policy]
    R3[Ring 3: Trust Validation\nDetect + Validate: goal integrity, UEBA, Rule of Two, adversarial testing, evidence]
    RP[Runtime and Response Plane\nContain + Recover + Re-establish]
    TEL[Telemetry, Evidence, Findings]
    POL[Adaptive Trust Policies]

    SO --> CP
    CP --> POL
    POL --> R2
    R1 --> ATF
    ATF --> R2
    R2 --> RP
    RP --> TEL
    TEL --> R3
    R3 --> CP
    RP --> ATF
    CP --> SO
